ioTip:"Regular table service fee ratio/insurance income ratio/MTT service fee ratio",UIGuildClubDetailsCowboyTip:"Cowboy income",UIGuildPicNotify:"Lobby banner",UIClubPicNotifySettingOne:"Picture 1",UIClubPicNotifySettingTwo:"Picture 2",UIClubPicNotifySettingThree:"Picture 3",UIClubPicNotifySettingTime:"Set notification period",UIClubPicNotifyPicRule:"Supports images in jpg and png formats, with a size of 800*800 pixels and no more than 1MB.",UIOpen:"turn on",UIMTTApplyNoTicketTips:"Sorry, you currently do not have tickets for this competition. Please register for other competitions~",UIMineLimitTime:"Validity period",UIMineTicketUseTips:"Only available for certain competitions",UIGuild_MembeDetailGiveOutTip:"Club issues players",UIGuild_MembeDetailRecycleTip:"Club Retrieving Players",UIGuild_MembeDetailWinTip:"Player winning Value",UIGuild_MembeDetailRBTip:"Service Fee Refunding",UIGuild_MembeDetailNumberTip:"Quantity",UIFantasy_Dizhu:"Ante:",MsgInfo_1012:"{0}Give you {1}, please check it out",UIGuildMemberOperationRegularDayTip:"Day / issued once",UIGuildMemberOperationRegularWeekTip:"Weeks / Issued once",UIGuildMemberOperationRegularNumberTip:"Enter 1-30",UIGuildOpenPicNotifyTips:"Please upload the image first, then enable the announcement!",UIGuildMemberOperationRealTimeTip:"Real Time",UIGuildMemberOperationRegularText:"Periodic",UIGuildMemberOperationGiveTypeText:"Issue Type",UIGuildMemberOperationGiveTypeTip:"Time are based on UTC+0. \\n1, choose to issue by day, every these days to issue a rebate (fill in the range of 1-30), set the next day 0:00 effective. \\n2, choose to issue by week, every these weeks to issue a rebate (fill in the range of 1-30), set the next day after 0:00 effective. Issue time is every Monday. \\n3, after modifying the cycle setting, the next day 0:00 starts to execute the new cycle, and the previously unissued portion will be issued to the player.",UIGuildMemberOperationWeekText:"Weekly",UIMine_BillClubReturnRatioText:"Club Rebate",MsgInfo_2022:"You have received a service fee rebate {1} from {0}",UIGuildFun2ClubReturnRatioText:"Retrieve Player Balance",UIJoinChannelSuccess:"Join channel successfully",UIGuildWeekReportDialogWinContent:"Win/Loss",UIGuildWeekReportDialogFeeContent:"Total Club Service Fee",UIGuildWeekReportDialogINSContent:"Total Club Insurance Income and Expense",UIGuildWeekReportDialogPRBContent:"$ Individual Service Fee Rebate (%)",UIGuildWeekReportDialogCRBContent:"$ Club Service Fee Rebate (CRB = FEE + INS - PRB)",UIGuildWeekReportTip:"Report",UICreateRoom_zuidiruju:"Minimum Entry Points:",UICreateRoom_paijuyajin:"Game Deposit",UICreateRoom_playerNumber:"{0}person",UICreateRoom_baipaiTime:"Time to act",UICreateRoom_createFantasy:"Create ToroFlops table",UIBombpot_Introduce:"Bomb pot is played by skipping the pre-flop round of betting, with each player betting the bomb pot ante, and the game starting on the flop. \\n\\nBomb pot is available for PLO4, PLO5 and PLO6. Each hand has a bomb pot and two suits of play, where two suits are two sets of community cards dealt.",UIGuildClubMemeberAmountTip:"Amount",UIDelayTable:"Extend Game",UIDelayTips:"Extend Hints",UIDelayTips2:"Sure to extend your game?",UIDelayTips3:"Sure to send a request to admin to extend the game by 1h？",UIDelayTips4:"Extension request submitted",UIDelayTips5:"Extension request rejected",UIDelayTips6:"Game extension {0}H succeeded",UIDelayTableApply:"Extension request",UIFantasy_Introduce:'Regular Rules: \\n1, Deal 7 cards to each player.\\n2, Group cards in 2/2/2, discard an extra card and click "OK", you can\'t change the grouping again.\\n3,  Deal 3*3 total 9 cards to 3 boards as public cards.\\n4, Match 3 groups of 2/2/2 hand cards with 3 sets of board, cannot be changed after confirmation. \\n5. In the same order as before, deal each board turn (hidden cards), then deal each board river (hidden cards).\\n6, Showdown the 1st board hand and all public cards(show part of the result).\\n7, Showdown the 2nd board hand and all public cards (show partial results).\\n8, Showdown the 3rd board hand and all public cards (show part of the result). \\n9,  Summarize results, calculate bonus, and proceed to next round. \\n\\nToroFlops Special Rules: \\n1, When a player gets a full house in any board, which is composed of 3 cards J/Q/K/A, the next round will enter Fantasy.\\n2, Fantasy player has a clear visual incentive. \\n3, Fantasy players have 12 cards and no grouping is required. Non-fantasy players need to be group as usual. \\n4, After the 3 board flop public cards are dealt, fantasy players directly choose 6 of the 12 cards group as 2/2/2 to match each board. Non-Fantasy players same as regularl rules. \\n5, Follow regular rules and showdown \\n6, Summarize results and proceed to next round.',UIFantasy_scoring:"Scoring statistics",UIFantasy_Introduce2:"Scoring rules\\n1, Direct comparison when there are 2 players; when there are 3 players, a two-by-two comparison is made and the final sum is taken to calculate the score. \\n2, Total scoring value = Hand patterns points difference + win/loss points + extra points from the whole game\\n3, Hand patterns points are as follows, get the specified hand patterns to get the corresponding points",UIFantasy_Introduce3:"4. If a board is Nuts in your hand, that board gets a special bonus of +10 pts and a Nuts icon.\\n5. Each winning board scores +2 pts, a loss −2 pts, a tie 0 pts. (Royal Flush>Straight Flush>Four of a Kind>Full House>Flush>Straight>Three of a Kind>Two Pair>One Pair>High Card)\\n6. A Full win against a player (win all 3 boards head-to-head) adds +10 pts to the winner and −10 pts to the loser.\\n7. Totals are then shown as the difference.",UIDelayOneHours:"Apply for 1 hour extension",UIClub_CreateRoomFengdingDizhu:"Cap(ante)",UIFantasy_handcard:"Hand",UIFantasy_finalresult:"FINAL RESULTS PLAYERS",UIFantasy_boards:"Boards",UIFantasy_bonus:"Bonus points",UIFantasy_nuts:"Nuts",UIFantasy_fullwin:"Full wins",UIFantasy_fulldefeat:"Full defeat",UIGuildWeekReportGiveOne:"Issued once",OpCodeString_DELAYFRIENDTABLE:"Extend table-Home Game",OpCodeString_DELAYINSIDETABLE:"Extend table-{0}",OpCodeString_DELAYFRIENDRTN:"Extended table refund-Home Game",OpCodeString_DELAYINSIDERTN:"Extended table refund-{0}",UIGuildWeekReportIssued:"Issued",UIGuildWeekReportUnissued:"Not issued",UIGuildWeekReportWeeklyTip:"Weekly report",UIGuildWeekReportWeeklyRBBillTip:"Rakeback",UIFantasy_dairuyajin:"Deposit",UIFantasy_Dizhu2:"Antes",UIFantasy_Jinfan:"Enter Fantasy Mode",UIFantasy_Jinfanshu:"Number of entering Fantasy Mode",UIFantasy_zuizhongshenglv:"Final Winning Rate",UIFantasy_tezhongpaixinglv:"Special type Rate",OpCodeString_CLOSEINSIDETABLE:"Close-{0}",OpCodeString_CLOSEFRIENDTABLE:"Closed-Friends Table",UIFantasy_zuizhongshenglvTips:"Number of wins per hand",UIFantasy_JinfanshuTips:"Number of access to Fantasy Mode",UIFantasy_tezhongpaixinglvTips:"Number of getting nuts",UIDelayApplySendApply:"Player {0} and {1} other players sent requests",OpCodeString_AUDIOTABLEFEE:"Voice table fee - {0}",OpCodeString_AUDIOTABLEFEERTN:"Voice Table Refund - {0}",OpCodeString_FACETABLEFEE:"Face Recognition Table Fee - {0}",OpCodeString_FACETABLEFEERTN:"Face Recognition Table Refund - {0}",UINotifyChangePic:"Replace",UIHasExpired:"Expired",UIGuildUpdateHelloTip:"welcome message",UIGuildUpdateHelloIntroductions:"Automatically send welcome message to new joining members ",UIGuildChangeNameTip:"Modify club nickname",UIDateScrollViewTip:"Maximum search time span is 30 days",UIDialogFullScreenWarning:"Warning!",UIMineAccountBinding:"Account Bindings",UIMineAccountPWApplication:"Password Usage",UIMineAccountQuickLogin:"Quick Login",UIMineAccountBringPW:"Buy-in Password",UIMineAccountModifyPW:"Passwords",UIMineAccountModifyLoginPW:"Change login password",UIMineAccountGesPW:"Gesture Password",UIMineAccountSixPW:"6-digit password",UIMineAccountDeviceManagement:"Device Management",UIMineAccountLoginDevice:"Login Device Management",UIMi